			"notes": {
				"rationale": "gemoppelt replaces genäht in the proverb, a rhyme echo of doppelt. Duden and DWDS both list it as a headword (DWDS: partizipiales Adjektiv, only in doppelt gemoppelt), so by the round-1 ruling on idiom-only words it is a Lexeme ADJ of its own, as Kunstgras is a NOUN in Er biss ins Kunstgras. Uninflected after the Saying's Doppelt, and like doppeltgemoppelt it has no comparison."
			},
